#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/mvm/mvm.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/mvm/mvm.rst:7
msgid ""
"MVM (Morpheus Virtual Machine) Cloud, also known as HVM (HPE Virtual "
"Machine), is |morpheus|'s native KVM-based hypervisor platform. Unlike "
"MVM *Clusters* which are managed via ``Infrastructure > Clusters``, the "
"MVM Cloud integration provides a cloud-level abstraction for provisioning"
" and managing KVM virtual machines across distributed hypervisor hosts."
msgstr ""
"MVM (Morpheus Virtual Machine) Cloud, también known as HVM (HPE Virtual "
"Machine), es |morpheus|'s native KVM-based hypervisor platform. Unlike "
"MVM *Clusters* cual son managed via ``Infrastructure > Clusters``, el MVM"
" Cloud integration provides una nube-level abstraction para provisioning "
"y managing KVM virtual machines across distributed hypervisor hosts."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/mvm/mvm.rst:9
msgid ""
"The MVM Cloud integration uses the ``kvmContainerService`` for "
"provisioning and ``MvmHostService`` for host management."
msgstr ""
"The MVM Cloud integration uses el ``kvmContainerService`` para "
"provisioning y ``MvmHostService`` para host management."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/mvm/mvm.rst:11
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/mvm/mvm.rst:11
msgid ""
"MVM Cloud and MVM Clusters serve different purposes. The MVM Cloud is a "
"traditional cloud integration for VM provisioning. MVM Clusters provide "
"clustered hypervisor management with features like HA, live migration, "
"and shared storage. Both use KVM underneath."
msgstr ""
"MVM Cloud y MVM Clusters serve diferente purposes. The MVM Cloud es un "
"traditional cloud integration para VM provisioning. MVM Clusters provide "
"clustered hypervisor management con características like HA, live "
"migration, y shared storage. Both use KVM underneath."

